Ta-da!

00:53:29.308 --> 00:53:31.343
Congrats sa pagresign!

00:53:33.279 --> 00:53:36.014
Kahit gaano pa natin inaasahan at pinaghandaan,

00:53:37.448 --> 00:53:39.885
