Manatili ka ring malapit kay Propesor Song.

00:55:19.066 --> 00:55:20.252
Hindi mo alam.

00:55:20.252 --> 00:55:22.287
Teka... ako?

00:55:23.366 --> 00:55:25.946
Dahil tapos ka na, kumain na tayo.

00:55:25.946 --> 00:55:29.495
May klase ako,
kaya kailangan kong pumunta sa Ansan. Pasensya na.

00:55:29.495 --> 00:55:31.596
Ah, sige.

